sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant VV as VisualView
    participant Eng as Engine
    participant Mod as adoc-model
    participant Doc as Document and undo history
    participant Views
    User->>VV: Types (or IME commits)
    VV->>Eng: visual.insert_text<br/>(version, selection in source offsets, marks)
    activate Eng
    Eng->>Eng: Refuse if the version is older than the document's<br/>Rebuild the model first if it is stale
    Eng->>Mod: apply(Step::InsertText)
    Mod-->>Eng: StepResult: source edits, selection after,<br/>updated model (local steps only)
    Eng->>Doc: apply_edits (typing coalesces within 500 ms)
    Doc-->>Eng: Version bump, adoc-parser re-parse
    alt Local step
        Eng->>Eng: Keep the updated model<br/>and schedule a rebuild after MODEL_SETTLE
    else Structural step
        Eng->>Eng: Rebuild the model from a fresh parse now
    end
    Eng-->>Views: DocumentChanged, ModelChanged
    deactivate Eng
    Views->>Views: Source editor applies the edits to its buffer<br/>Visual editor redraws from the model<br/>Preview re-renders after its settle time
    Note over Eng,Mod: Undo restores the source edits, marks the model stale<br/>and rebuilds it before returning
